Mage=
As the [[Totem (Phosani's Nightmare)|Totems]] possess no stats, magic accuracy is not beneficial. Prioritise adding as many magic damage switches as possible, as all magic damage is increased significantly. If an item only adds accuracy without increasing your max hit, it is not worth bringing. Consider using a DPS calculator or the [[combat dummy]] to see if an item gives you a max hit in your specific gear.

Eye of Ayak and Tumeken's shadow share a similar damage output in spite of their different attack speeds and max hit when both are using the same gear, boosts and prayers; the max hit of a shadow is 70, whereas an eye of Ayak has a max hit of 44 (when accounting for a [[Elidinis' ward (f)|fortified Elidinis ward]]) The only notable difference is the long range style; long range Ayak has a range of 8, while the shadow has a range of 10. This difference is most appreciated during '''Flower Power''', as the ayak can only hit the pillar diagonally across from the safe zone while under the boss, whereas the shadow can safely attack without running under.

