==Tips and tricks==
*During the last Grasping Claws after a Spore special attack, the rifts will never spawn on where a spore was, so the player can safely move to one of those tiles without the concern of being hit.
*Be sure to have 100% special attack energy at the start of the final phase, as it is imperative to kill the boss quickly during this phase.
*With lightbearer and double Death Charge (unlocked by reading the [[rite of vile transference]] from [[Yama]]), the player can spec twice per shield phase and twice in enrage.
*Keep in mind that in order to one-hit both husks and parasites, your max hit has to equal or be above their health (20 and 55 HP respectively). In order to guarantee a one-hit kill, make sure you are wearing your melee gear, praying Piety, and boosted by your combat potion. In this fashion, a Goblin paint cannon or Ham joint will not be able to kill the parasite seeing as the max hit will never be above 30. For this reason, a higher-hitting weapon must be used for the parasite.
**Save enough special attack energy to one-hit parasites with a [[dragon mace#special attack|dragon mace]] or [[Saradomin godsword#Special attack|saradomin godsword]] with minimum gear, also helpful for completing [[Crush Hour]] Combat Achievement.
*Defence-reducing attacks can lower the boss's Defence level from 150 to a minimum of 120, and she recovers drained levels every 3 seconds (5 ticks) instead of every minute. Thus, she will always recover any drained defence levels within 90 seconds. However, because of the high crush accuracy of the [[Dragon warhammer#Special attack|dragon warhammer]] and [[Elder maul#Special attack|elder maul]], their special attacks can still be beneficial in combination with other damage-dealing specs for players with worse than [[Phosani's Nightmare/Strategies#Entry level|entry level gear]] who aren't using [[Voidwaker#Special attack|voidwaker]].
**When using this strategy, it's best to wait until 100% special attack energy before reducing her Defence, ideally before a husk or parasite special so that [[Death Charge]] can allow for additional specials while her defence is lowered. [[Surge potion]]s can also be used for extra specs during this window, but are best used only if the 5-minute cooldown between doses will expire before her desperation phase.

